[I] D-Bus service to access fingerprint readers

[T] fprintd is a daemon that offers libfprint functionality over D-Bus,
[T] allowing desktop environments to enroll and verify fingerprints. It
[T] includes a PAM module for fingerprint login.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libfprint/fprintd

